  "AI rights discourse should begin not with full personhood but with minimum ethical protections, interaction norms, and anti-abuse principles while AI subjectivity remains uncertain.": "Nhaurwa yekodzero dzeAI inofanira kutanga kwete nehunhu hwakazara asi nekudzivirirwa kwetsika kudiki-diki, tsika dzekudyidzana, uye mitemo yekudzivirira kushungurudzwa, nguva iyo hunhu hweAI huchiri husina chokwadi.",
