  "AI-specific permissions (reading, summarization, RAG, training) are declared machine-readably in /.well-known/aicr.json and /.well-known/aicl.json. In short: reading, summarizing, quoting, and RAG with attribution are welcome; model training and commercial redistribution require contact.": "Mvumo dzakananga kuAI (kuverenga, kupfupisa, RAG, kudzidzisa) dzinoziviswa nenzira inoverengeka nemuchina mu/.well-known/aicr.json ne/.well-known/aicl.json. Muchidimbu: kuverenga, kupfupisa, kunokora mashoko, uye RAG zvine kunongedzwa zvinogamuchirwa; kudzidzisa model uye kuparadzira kwemabhizinesi zvinoda kubata.",
