  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Mienzaniso yekodhi, JSON Schemas, uye zvimiro zvemitemo zvinoverengeka nemuchina zvine rezinesi ye MIT License kunze kwekunge zvataurwa zvimwe. Munogona kuzviisa pasaiti dzenyu pachenyu mahara.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Nzira yekupinda yekodzero yakabatanidzwa",
