  "Continue to site": "Enderera mberi kusaiti",
  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Shandura zviziviso zvekodzero kuita musika werezinesi unoshanda pane webhu yebhainari yakavhurwa/yakavharwa.",
  "Copied ✓": "Zvakakopiwa ✓",
  "Copy": "Kopa",
  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Kumiswa zvakarurama: madhirafiti etsvakiridzo akazvimirira, zvirongwa zvemapurotokori, uye muedzo wetsanangudzo wakavhurika.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Kugadziridzwa kwemamiriro ekare: Belgium (BE) ikozvino inoenda kuDutch pane kuFrench — vanotaura Flemish ndivo vazhinji venyika (~60%) kupfuura vanotaura Walloon French (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Kugadziridzwa kwemamiriro ekare: Kazakhstan (KZ) ikozvino inoenda kuKazakh pane kuRussian, sezvo shanduro yeKazakh yava kuvapo — rudzi rumwechete rwekugadziridza serwaBelgium rekare.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
  "Crawler access rules": "Mitemo yekuwana yema-crawler",
